reen/accent pill).\\n6. Floating Top-Center: crosshair readout frosted glass pill '11/08 16:00 · 开 2,001.2 高 2,010.0 低 1,998.4 收 2,007.4' in crisp tabular monospace.\\n7. Floating Top-Right: a small round frosted glass button (36x36) with portrait-rotate/screen_rotation icon to switch back to portrait mode.\\n8. Floating Bottom-Left: a single-row compact frosted glass period dock containing '1m', '5m', '15m' (active in blue #0A84FF), '1H', '4H', '12H', '1D' plus a tune/sliders settings icon button and a follow/sync crosshair icon button.\\n9. STRICT NEGATIVE CONSTRAINTS: NO bottom navigation tab bar, NO top coin strip in landscape. Pure edge-to-edge chart immersion.\\n10. Candlesticks show clean candles with touch marker at 下 1.618 rebound, volume profile at bottom, crisp professional quant aesthetics. Synthetic placeholder data only. Chinese copy verbatim.\",\"name\":\"projects/8978791379095391159/screens/8a33888410d84f60b52d667bd9b0160c\",\"theme\":{\"colorMode\":\"LIGHT\",\"font\":\"INTER\",\"roundness\":\"ROUND_FULL\",\"customColor\":\"#0a84ff\",\"headlineFont\":\"INTER\",\"bodyFont\":\"INTER\",\"labelFont\":\"INTER\",\"namedColors\":{\"primary\":\"#005ab3\",\"secondary_fixed_dim\":\"#6adbb1\",\"primary_fixed\":\"#d6e3ff\",\"surface\":\"#f9f9ff\",\"on_primary_fixed\":\"#001b3e\",\"surface_container_low\":\"#f1f3ff\",\"surface_container_highest\":\"#dce2f7\",\"outline_variant\":\"#c0c6d6\",\"inverse_primary\":\"#aac7ff\",\"tertiary\":\"#b41645\",\"on_primary_fixed_variant\":\"#00468d\",\"inverse_surface\":\"#293040\",\"on_surface\":\"#141b2b\",\"surface_container_high\":\"#e1e8fd\",\"on_tertiary\":\"#ffffff\",\"secondary_container\":\"#85f4c9\",\"tertiary_fixed_dim\":\"#ffb2bb\",\"on_error_container\":\"#93000a\",\"surface_container_lowest\":\"#ffffff\",\"on_secondary_fixed\":\"#002116\",\"on_secondary_container\":\"#007153\",\"background\":\"#f9f9ff\",\"surface_container\":\"#e9edff\",\"surface_tint
